    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Add Client Gaming Transactions" id="test-1">
            <p><b>Scenario:</b> Add Gaming Transaction</p>
            <p>Creates a new gaming transaction using faker-generated values</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <p><b>Test Data:</b> Faker IPv4, userAgent, numeric fields, external reference</p>
            <step>Load individual client from fixture and navigate to newest client</step>
            <step>Open Gaming Transactions and click Add</step>
            <step>Fill required fields (date, IP, device, volume, play times, country, limits, ext ref, comments)</step>
            <step>Select game type and link to a gaming account</step>
            <step>Save the transaction</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• Transaction is created successfully</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
